      "nets": ["POT", "PWM", "RST", "SCK", "SDA", "TACH"],
      "observed": "Both U2 (ATtiny45-20P) and U3 (ATtiny13V-10S) are present in the netlist, and their corresponding GPIO and reset pins are connected to the same nets. For example, both PB1 pins share PWM, both PB2 pins share SCK, and both reset pins share RST. No mutually exclusive population or isolation is indicated.",
